  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞打开被封住的门，\n　来到开阔的地方，\n　决定稍作休息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 01 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}啊，这段文化祭生活\n也快要结束了啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}真舍不得呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}嗯。\n我们的文化祭才刚因为\n台风泡汤了嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}哦，原来是这样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}月光馆校舍那么大，\n文化祭一定也很热闹吧。\n下次真想去玩。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}哈哈，我们去的时候，\n真的就只顾着学习了呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……你们来过\n月光馆学园？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}啊，是的。\n今年的交流会。\n好像是９月吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}交流会？\n我没听说过这种活动……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}啊，那天好像是月光馆的休校日，\n只有部分学生在学校，\n所以可能没多少人知道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}就算如此，\n身为学生会长的美鹤也不该不知道……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦，我们见到的学生会长，\n是位叫伏见的人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}因为是个特别漂亮的眼镜美女，\n所以我记得很清楚！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}伏见？\n那家伙还只是１年级啊！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦？\n她说自己是３年级……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 01}说起来，刚才伊织\n提到“台风”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 12 01}最近有台风来过吗？\n１０月都快结束了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 13 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}１０月……？\n应该还是９月才对。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 14 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}请、请等一下。\n确认一下……你们那边是公元哪年？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0E 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 01}２００９年。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e400/e410_031.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0B 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 16 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}哎！？\n现在是２０１１年吧！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
